# SignalX Brand Design System

Follow `docs/SIGNALX_BRAND_DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` as the source of truth.

- Shell: navy sidebar, white header, `#FAFAFA` canvas, soft rounded chrome, pill statuses.
- Not Material 2 — calm enterprise SaaS fluency (Threats screen reference).
- Tokens: blue step `#2563EB`/`#1E40AF`; purple brand `#8036CB`/`#5B21B6`; links `#166434`; tier `#F3E8FF`/`#6B21A8`.
- Onboarding: Tinder stack — Google (blue) → GitHub (purple) → end 😊❤️. No Mario/mascot.
- Motion: `motion/react` for card swipe/entrance only.
